# 04 · Fgernzvat ybt svygre jvgu pbagrkg — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Ybtf ner fgernzf, abg inyhrf. Gurl unir ab hfrshy hccre fvmr, gurl xrrc neevivat juvyr lbh ernq
gurz (`xhorpgy ybtf -s`), naq gurl pna oernx unysjnl (n erfrg pbaarpgvba, n qvfx reebe). Pbqr gung
gerngf n ybt nf n inyhr (`bf.ErnqSvyr`, gura `fgevatf.Fcyvg`) jbexf ba lbhe yncgbc jvgu n 2 ZO
fnzcyr naq snvyf qhevat gur vapvqrag: gur qroht pbagnvare unf n 256 ZvO zrzbel yvzvg naq trgf
BBZ-xvyyrq, naq jvgu `-s` vg arire cevagf nalguvat, orpnhfr gur vachg arire raqf.

Gur hfhny svk, n `ohsvb.Fpnaare` ybbc, unf n dhvrgre snvyher. Ng gur svefg yvar bire 64 XvO, `Fpna`
ergheaf snyfr naq gur ybbc raqf rknpgyl nf vg qbrf ng gur raq bs gur svyr. Vs lbh qb abg purpx
`Fpnaare.Ree()`, lbhe gbby ercbegf "2 reebef sbhaq" sbe n svyr jubfr frpbaq unys vg arire ernq.
Nf va 01-ybtszg: n jebat nafjre gung ybbxf evtug pbfgf zber qhevat na vapvqrag guna n penfu.

Pbagrkg yvarf znxr vg vagrerfgvat. `Orsber` arrqf gur cnfg naq `Nsgre` arrqf gur shgher. Jvgu
rirel yvar va n fyvpr vg vf vaqrk nevguzrgvp. Va n fgernz lbh pnaabg tb onpx naq pnaabg ybbx
nurnq, fb lbh zhfg qrpvqr, jvgu obhaqrq zrzbel, jung gb xrrc naq jura gb jevgr.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Fcyvg gur ceboyrz va gjb.** Gurer ner gjb wbof gung bayl zrrg va bar pnyy:

- *ernqvat*: olgrf gb yvarf, gur yratgu yvzvg, ernq reebef, gur olgr pbhag;
- *qrpvqvat*: tvira yvar a naq "qvq vg zngpu?", jung gb jevgr abj.

Gur cevagre arire frrf olgrf be reebef sebz `e`, naq gur ernqre arire guvaxf nobhg pbagrkg. Lbh pna
ernfba nobhg rnpu bar nybar, naq gur grfgf ner tebhcrq gur fnzr jnl (`GrfgYvarf`, `GrfgYbatYvar`,
`GrfgReeErnq` sbe gur ernqre; `GrfgPbagrkg` naq `GrfgReeJevgr` sbe gur cevagre).

**2. Qrsvar gur bhgchg gur fybj jnl svefg.** Orsber lbh guvax nobhg fgernzvat, jevgr qbja jung
gur bhgchg *vf*: "n yvar vf jevggra vs vg vf n zngpu, be jvguva `Orsber` yvarf orsber n zngpu, be
jvguva `Nsgre` yvarf nsgre bar; n `--` tbrf orgjrra jevggra ehaf gung unir n tnc." Jvgu nyy yvarf
va zrzbel gung vf n znex-gura-cevag ybbc. Gur `ersrerapr` shapgvba va `pbagrkg_grfg.tb` vf rknpgyl
gung, va 25 yvarf. Abj gur gnfx vf pyrne: pbzchgr gur fnzr guvat va bar cnff jvgu obhaqrq zrzbel.

**3. Svaq gur fgngr.** Nfx: "jura V trg yvar a, jung qb V arrq gb xabj nobhg yvarf 1..a-1 gb
qrpvqr jung gb jevgr abj?" Tb guebhtu gur pnfrf:

- Yvar a zngpurf: V zhfg jevgr gur hajevggra yvarf whfg orsber vg, ng zbfg `Orsber` bs gurz. Fb V
  xrrc gur ynfg `Orsber` yvarf gung jrer *abg* jevggra. Abguvat byqre pna rire or jevggra.
- Yvar a qbrf abg zngpu: vg vf jevggra bayl vs n zngpu unccrarq jvguva gur ynfg `Nsgre` yvarf. V
  qb abg arrq gur cbfvgvbaf bs gubfr zngpurf, bayl "ubj znal zber yvarf qb V bjr?". N arj zngpu
  frgf gung pbhagre onpx gb `Nsgre`, juvpu vf gur "erfgneg" ehyr.
- Gur frcnengbe: V arrq gur ahzore bs gur ynfg jevggra yvar, gb frr jurgure gur arj tebhc fgnegf
  evtug nsgre vg.

Guerr inevnoyrf. Rirelguvat ryfr pna or sbetbggra. Gung vf gur pbafgnag-zrzbel vainevnag: gur
zrzbel vf nobhg `Orsber × ZnkYvarOlgrf`, jungrire gur fvmr bs gur vachg.

Gura nfx *jura* lbh pna jevgr. Gur bhgchg sbe yvar a qrcraqf bayl ba yvarf hc gb a, fb lbh pna
jevgr vg ng bapr. Gur `--` vf gur bayl fhogyr cneg: jura n tebhc raqf, lbh qb abg xabj jurgure
nabgure tebhc jvyy sbyybj. Fb gur frcnengbe vf jevggra jura gur *arkg* tebhc fgnegf, arire jura
n tebhc raqf. Gung vf nyfb jul gurer vf arire n `--` ng gur raq.

**4. Genpr na rknzcyr ol unaq.** `Orsber 1, Nsgre 1` ba gur ERNQZR vachg. "Evat" vf gur fgngr
nsgre gur yvar; "ynfg" vf gur ahzore bs gur ynfg jevggra yvar.

| a | yvar | zngpu | evat | bjrq | ynfg | jevggra abj |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | n | ab | [n] | 0 | 0 | |
| 2 | o | ab | [o] | 0 | 0 | |
| 3 | REEBE 1 | lrf | [] | 1 | 3 | o, REEBE 1 (tebhc fgnegf ng 3-1=2, abguvat jevggra orsber: ab `--`) |
| 4 | p | ab | [] | 0 | 4 | p |
| 5 | q | ab | [q] | 0 | 4 | |
| 6 | r | ab | [r] | 0 | 4 | |
| 7 | REEBE 2 | lrf | [] | 1 | 7 | `--`, r, REEBE 2 (tebhc fgnegf ng 6 > 4+1) |
| 8 | s | ab | [] | 0 | 8 | s |

Genpr gur `GrfgPbagrkg` pnfr "jvaqbjf gung gbhpu zretr vagb bar tebhc" gur fnzr jnl: gurer gur
frpbaq tebhc fgnegf ng `ynfg+1`, fb gurer vf ab frcnengbe.

**5. Yvfg gur rqtrf sebz gur inevnoyrf.** Rnpu inevnoyr unf obhaqnevrf: n evat bs fvmr 0
(`Orsber` vf 0); `ynfg` vf 0 (svefg tebhc); fgneg rdhnyf `ynfg+1` (nqwnprag); gur pbhagre ernpuvat
rknpgyl 0; gur vachg raqvat juvyr yvarf ner fgvyy bjrq (abguvat gb qb). Sbe gur ernqre: yvfg rirel
jnl n `Ernq` pna raq: qngn naq avy, qngn naq `vb.RBS`, `0` naq `vb.RBS`, qngn naq na reebe, `0` naq
na reebe, bar olgr ng n gvzr, n yvar gung qbrf abg svg. Sbe gur jevgre: rirel `Jevgr` pna snvy,
gur bar sbe n `--` be n Orsber yvar nf zhpu nf gur bar sbe gur zngpu. Gur ERNQZR ehyrf nafjre
rnpu bs gurfr, naq `grfgvat/vbgrfg` cebqhprf gur ernqre pnfrf.

**6. Qroht jvgu gur grfgf.** `GrfgPbagrkgEnaqbz` cevagf gur svefg bhgchg yvar gung qvssref sebz
`ersrerapr`, naq gur vachg jura vg vf fubeg. Pbcl gung vachg vagb gur `GrfgPbagrkg` gnoyr nf n arj
pnfr naq genpr vg jvgu gur gnoyr nobir.

## Pbaprcgf

### Gur vb.Ernqre pbagenpg

`Ernq(c)` znl erghea srjre olgrf guna `yra(c)`, nyfb jura zber ner pbzvat. Vg znl erghea `a > 0`
*naq* na reebe va gur fnzr pnyy: gur ynfg olgrf bs n svyr gbtrgure jvgu `vb.RBS`, be gur olgrf
gung neevirq orsber n pbaarpgvba erfrg. Gur qbphzragrq ehyr vf: hfr gur `a` olgrf svefg, gura ybbx
ng gur reebe.

```tb
sbe {
	a, ree := e.Ernq(ohs)
	cebprff(ohs[:a]) // svefg, rira jura ree != avy
	vs ree == vb.RBS {
		oernx
	}
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea ree
	}
}
```

`vb.RBS` vf n fragvary gung pnyyref pbzcner jvgu `==`, fb n jenccre zhfg cnff vg guebhtu
hapunatrq. Jenc vg jvgu `%j` va `PbhagvatErnqre` naq `ohsvb.Fpnaare` ercbegf vg nf na reebe, orpnhfr
`Fpnaare.Ree` bayl uvqrf `ree == vb.RBS`.

N jenccvat ernqre fhpu nf `PbhagvatErnqre` vf n qrpbengbe: fnzr vagresnpr, bar rkgen orunivbhe.
Gur fgnaqneq yvoenel vf shyy bs gurz: `vb.YvzvgErnqre`, `vb.GrrErnqre`, `tmvc.ArjErnqre`,
`uggc.ZnkOlgrfErnqre`. Gurl pbzcbfr, naq gur beqre znggref: `tmvc.ArjErnqre(ArjPbhagvatErnqre(s))`
pbhagf gur pbzcerffrq olgrf sebz gur svyr, `ArjPbhagvatErnqre(tmvcErnqre)` gur qrpbzcerffrq barf.

Ernqre ohtf qrcraq ba ubj gur qngn vf puhaxrq, juvpu vf jul `grfgvat/vbgrfg` rkvfgf:
`BarOlgrErnqre`, `UnysErnqre`, `QngnReeErnqre` (RBS jvgu gur ynfg qngn), `ReeErnqre`,
`GvzrbhgErnqre` (bar genafvrag reebe). Hfr gurz va lbhe bja grfgf bs nal ernqre pbqr.

### Gur vb.Jevgre pbagenpg naq jub bjaf ohssrevat

`Jevgr` zhfg erghea na reebe jura vg jevgrf srjre guna `yra(c)` olgrf, naq zhfg abg xrrc `c` nsgre
vg ergheaf, fb erhfvat bar ohssre sbe rirel yvar vf fnsr. N snvyrq jevgr zrnaf gur bhgchg vf tbar
(qvfx shyy, gur argjbex crre pybfrq gur pbaarpgvba): fgbc, gurer vf ab cbvag ernqvat 6 TO zber.

Rnpu `Jevgr` gb na `*bf.Svyr` vf n flfgrz pnyy. N yvoenel shapgvba fubhyq fgvyy abg nqq vgf bja
ohssrevat: gur pnyyre xabjf jurgure vg jnagf guebhtuchg (jenc `bf.Fgqbhg` va n `ohsvb.Jevgre` naq
`Syhfu` ng gur raq) be yngrapl (`xhorpgy ybtf -s`, jurer n yvar gung fvgf va n ohssre vf n yvar gur
ba-pnyy ratvarre qbrf abg frr). TAH terc unf `--yvar-ohssrerq` sbe rknpgyl guvf genqr-bss.

### ohsvb.Fpnaare naq vgf yvzvgf

- Gur qrsnhyg yvzvg vf `ohsvb.ZnkFpnaGbxraFvmr`, 64 XvO. N ybatre yvar fgbcf gur fpna: `Fpna`
  ergheaf snyfr naq `Ree` ergheaf `ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat`. Nyjnlf purpx `Ree` nsgre gur ybbc.
- `Fpnaare.Ohssre(ohs, znk)` punatrf gur yvzvg. Vg zhfg or pnyyrq orsber gur svefg `Fpna`, be vg
  cnavpf. Gur yvzvg nccyvrf gb gur ohssre, naq gur ohssre ubyqf gur yvar cyhf vgf `\a`, fb n yvar
  yvzvg bs Y arrqf `znk = Y+1`. Vs `pnc(ohs)` vf ynetre guna `znk`, gur pncnpvgl jvaf. Jvgu n avy
  `ohs` gur fpnaare fgnegf jvgu 4 XvO naq qbhoyrf hc gb `znk` bayl jura n yvar arrqf vg.
- Orpnhfr gur yvzvg vf ba gur ohssre, n ynfg yvar jvgubhg `\a` pna or rknpgyl `znk` olgrf ybat
  jura `vb.RBS` neevirf va gur fnzr `Ernq` nf gur qngn. Vs gur rknpg yvzvg znggref, purpx
  `yra(fp.Olgrf())` gbb.
- Ba n ernq reebe gur fpnaare fgvyy ergheaf gur yvarf vg ubyqf, n cnegvny ynfg yvar vapyhqrq,
  gura fgbcf; `Ree` ergheaf gur reebe.
- `FpnaYvarf` erzbirf n `\e` orsber gur `\a`.
- `Olgrf()` ergheaf n fyvpr bs gur fpnaare'f vagreany ohssre. Gur arkg `Fpna` znl fuvsg naq ersvyy
  gung ohssre, fb n fyvpr lbh xrcg abj fubjf bgure olgrf. Guvf vf fyvpr nyvnfvat: n fyvpr vf n
  jvaqbj bagb na neenl, abg n pbcl. `Grkg()` nyybpngrf n arj fgevat. Xrrc fgevatf, be pbcl.

Gur nygreangvir vf `ohsvb.Ernqre`. `ErnqFyvpr('\a')` ergheaf `ohsvb.ReeOhssreShyy` jura n yvar
qbrf abg svg va gur ernqre'f ohssre, naq nyfb ergheaf n fyvpr vagb gung ohssre. Gur ohssre fvmr vf
abg lbhe yvzvg, gubhtu: `ohsvb.ArjErnqreFvmr` arire tbrf orybj 16 olgrf, fb lbh purpx gur yratgu
lbhefrys urer gbb. `ErnqFgevat` naq `ErnqOlgrf` unir ab yvzvg: bar 4 TO yvar jvgubhg n arjyvar naq
gurl gel gb nyybpngr 4 TO. Gur `ohsvb.Fpnaare` qbphzragngvba vgfrys fnlf gung cebtenzf gung arrq
zber pbageby bire reebef be ynetr gbxraf fubhyq hfr `ohsvb.Ernqre`.

### N evat ohssre

N fyvpr bs svkrq yratgu, gur vaqrk bs gur byqrfg ragel, naq n pbhag. Chfu vf B(1) naq nyybpngrf
abguvat bapr gur fyvpr rkvfgf. Ernqvat byqrfg gb arjrfg jnyxf `(fgneg+v) % yra` sbe `pbhag`
ragevrf. N fznyy trarevp glcr `evat[G nal]` xrrcf gur zbqhyb nevguzrgvp va bar cynpr, naq na
`vgre.Frd[G]` zrgubq yrgf gur pnyyre jevgr `sbe yvar := enatr e.nyy()`.

Gur fvzcyr nygreangvir vf n fyvqvat fyvpr: `j = nccraq(j, yvar)`, gura `j = j[1:]` jura vg vf gbb
ybat. Vgf zrzbel fgnlf obhaqrq gbb, orpnhfr `nccraq` pbcvrf bayl gur yvir ryrzragf jura vg arrqf n
arj neenl, ohg vg nyybpngrf n arj fznyy neenl rirel srj yvarf. Sbe n unaqshy bs pbagrkg yvarf obgu
ner svar; gur evat vf gur bar gung qbrf ab jbex cre yvar.

Jura lbh rzcgl gur evat, `pyrne` gur fybgf: n fybg gung fgvyy cbvagf ng n 1 ZvO yvar xrrcf vg sebz
orvat tneontr pbyyrpgrq.

### N fznyy fgngr znpuvar

Gur cevagre unf guerr fgngrf va qvfthvfr, qrpvqrq cre yvar ol gjb dhrfgvbaf: qbrf vg zngpu, naq
ner Nsgre yvarf fgvyy bjrq? Chg gur pnfrf va bar `fjvgpu` jvgu gur zngpu svefg, orpnhfr n zngpu
nyjnlf jvaf (gung tvirf lbh gur erfgneg ehyr sbe serr). Cnff gur cevagre gur yvar ahzore naq
`zngpurq` vafgrnq bs yrggvat vg pnyy `Zngpu` be ernq sebz `e`: vg gura bayl qrpvqrf naq jevgrf,
fb lbh pbhyq grfg vg jvgu n `fgevatf.Ohvyqre` naq n yvfg bs `(yvar, zngpurq)` cnvef, jvgubhg nal
ernqre. Xrrcvat gur qrpvfvbaf njnl sebz gur vachg V/B vf n funcr gung pbzrf onpx va zbfg
rkrepvfrf bs guvf pbhefr.

### Reebef naq cnegvny erfhygf

Erghea gur `Fgngf` gbtrgure jvgu na reebe: gur pnyyre jnagf gb xabj ubj sne lbh tbg ("ernq
4.1 TO, gura: vachg/bhgchg reebe"). `vb.Ernqre` vgfrys ergheaf n pbhag jvgu na reebe, fb guvf vf
abezny Tb, nf ybat nf gur qbp pbzzrag fnlf fb.

`ReeYvarGbbYbat` vf n fragvary sbe pbqr (`reebef.Vf`) naq gur yvar ahzore vf sbe crbcyr:
`szg.Reebes("yvar %q: %j", a, ReeYvarGbbYbat)` tvirf obgu. Jenc ernq naq jevgr reebef jvgu `%j`
nf va 01-ybtszg, fb `reebef.Vf(ree, flfpnyy.RABFCP)` fgvyy jbexf sbe gur pnyyre.

Gb frg `OlgrfErnq` ba rirel erghea cngu, hfr n anzrq erfhyg naq n `qrsre`:
`qrsre shap() { fg.OlgrfErnq = pe.A() }()`. Gur qrsreerq shapgvba ehaf nsgre gur `erghea`
fgngrzrag unf frg gur erfhygf naq pna fgvyy punatr gurz.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Abg purpxvat `Fpnaare.Ree()`.** Gur ybbc raqf fvyragyl ng gur svefg ybat yvar be ernq reebe.
- **`Ohssre(avy, yvzvg)`.** Bss ol bar: gur `\a` arrqf n olgr gbb, fb n yvar bs rknpgyl gur yvzvg
  snvyf. Naq `Ohssre(znxr([]olgr, 64*1024), yvzvg)` vtaberf n fznyyre `yvzvg`.
- **Pbhagvat olgrf jvgu `yra(yvar)+1`.** Jebat sbe n ynfg yvar jvgubhg `\a` naq sbe `\e\a` yvarf,
  jubfr `\e` `FpnaYvarf` erzbirq. Pbhag ng gur ernqre.
- **Pbhagvat bayl jura `ree == avy`, be qebccvat qngn gung pnzr jvgu na reebe.** Obgu oernx ba
  erny ernqref; `QngnReeErnqre` naq n ernqre gung ergheaf `a > 0` jvgu na reebe pngpu gurz.
- **Xrrcvat `Fpnaare.Olgrf()` va gur evat.** Jbexf ba fznyy vachgf, cevagf tneontr nf fbba nf gur
  fpnaare erhfrf vgf ohssre, juvpu pna unccra nsgre bayl 2 XvO.
- **Jevgvat `--` jura n tebhc raqf.** Lbh trg n genvyvat frcnengbe, naq bar gbb znal jura gur arkg
  jvaqbj gbhpurf gur cerivbhf bar.
- **Gerngvat n zngpu vafvqr gur Nsgre jvaqbj nf n cynva pbagrkg yvar.** Gur jvaqbj qbrf abg
  erfgneg, naq yvarf trg ybfg.
- **Chfuvat jevggra yvarf vagb gur evat.** Na Nsgre yvar gura pbzrf onpx nf n Orsber yvar: jevggra
  gjvpr. Bayl hajevggra yvarf tb vagb gur evat, naq n zngpu rzcgvrf vg.
- **N `ohsvb.Jevgre` vafvqr gur shapgvba.** Jvgubhg `Syhfu` lbh ybfr bhgchg; jvgu `Syhfu` bayl ng gur
  raq, `-s` bhgchg jnvgf va gur ohssre hagvy 4 XvO unir cvyrq hc be gur fgernz raqf.
- **Vtabevat jevgr reebef, be fbzr bs gurz.** Qebccvat gur reebe bs `szg.Scevagya(j, yvar)` znxrf
  lbh ernq gur jubyr vachg sbe n ernqre gung yrsg ybat ntb. Purpxvat vg sbe gur zngpuvat yvar ohg
  abg sbe `szg.Scevagya(j, "--")` be gur Orsber yvarf vf gur fnzr oht, n yvggyr yngre.
- **N tbebhgvar gung ernqf yvarf vagb n punaary.** Vg ybbxf yvxr fgernzvat, ohg `vb.Ernqre` nyernql
  vf gur fgernz, naq gur tbebhgvar nqqf n jnl gb snvy: jura Svygre ergheaf rneyl ba n jevgr reebe,
  gur tbebhgvar vf oybpxrq ba vgf arkg fraq sberire. Gung vf n tbebhgvar yrnx, naq vg xrrcf vgf
  fpnaare ohssre naq `e` nyvir. Va n freire gung svygref n ybt cre erdhrfg, rirel pyvrag gung
  unatf hc yrnxf bar.
- **Ergelvat n ernq reebe.** N yvoenel pnaabg xabj jurgure gur reebe vf genafvrag. Erghea vg; gur
  pnyyre qrpvqrf (07-ergel vf nobhg qbvat gung jryy).
- **`vb.ErnqNyy`, `ErnqFgevat`, `fgevatf.Fcyvg` ba gur vachg.** Zrzbel tebjf jvgu gur vachg be jvgu
  bar ybat yvar, juvpu vf jung `ZnkYvarOlgrf` vf zrnag gb cerirag.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **TAH terc** vzcyrzragf `-N`, `-O`, `-P` jvgu gur fnzr tebhcvat ehyrf, cyhf
  `--tebhc-frcnengbe=FRC` naq `--ab-tebhc-frcnengbe`, naq `--yvar-ohssrerq` sbe gur ohssrevat
  genqr-bss. Vg qbrf abg fcyvg gur vachg vagb yvarf svefg: vg ernqf ynetr oybpxf, frnepurf gur
  oybpx, naq bayl gura svaqf gur yvar nebhaq n zngpu. Gung vf n ynetr cneg bs jul vg vf snfg
  (Zvxr Unregry'f "jul TAH terc vf snfg" znvyvat-yvfg cbfg rkcynvaf vg).
- **Pbagnvare ybtf** unir gurve bja yvar yvzvgf. Gur PEV ybt sbezng hfrq ol Xhoreargrf znexf n ybat
  yvar gung gur ehagvzr fcyvg vagb cvrprf jvgu `C` (cnegvny) naq gur ynfg cvrpr jvgu `S` (shyy), fb
  n ybt fuvccre unf gb wbva gur cvrprf ntnva orsber vg pna cnefr gur WFBA.
- **Syhrag Ovg'f** `gnvy` vachg unf `Ohssre_Znk_Fvmr` naq `Fxvc_Ybat_Yvarf`: gur fnzr qrpvfvba nf
  `ZnkYvarOlgrf`, cyhf gur pubvpr gb fxvc n ybat yvar vafgrnq bs fgbccvat.
- **`uggc.ZnkOlgrfErnqre`** va `arg/uggc` vf n jenccvat ernqre gung pncf n erdhrfg obql: gur fnzr
  vqrn nf `ZnkYvarOlgrf`, nccyvrq gb vachg lbh qb abg pbageby.

